    "Id": "vehicledef_CONDOR_UPGRADE",
    "Name": "Condor CND-U66",
    "Details": "Despite the original being introduced in 2564 updated Condors are still in production as of the start of the 32nd Century. Substantial armor of at least six tons and various mid and long range weapon packages keep the Condor relevant. A heavy cavalry unit designed for rapid reaction to a shifting battle, the Condor was one of the few heavy hover tanks available at the time of it's introduction. This immense hovercraft is capable of a flank speed of 129 km/h and a cruising speed of 86 km/h, making it one of the fastest vehicles in its weight class. \n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 9/14 hexes / 270/420 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Ferro-Fibrous\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       150     25\n<b>Left</b>         140     25\n<b>Right</b>       140     25\n<b>Rear</b>         80     25\n<b>Turret</b>      145     25\n\n<b>Total</b>      655    125</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Quick Off The Line</color>",
    "Icon": "Condor"
  },
